# Lean local model for easy/medium coding tasks on 36GB Mac.
# Qwen 3.8 only ships 27B on Ollama today; qwen3:14b (~9.3GB) leaves
# headroom for KV cache + IDE + browser without the 27B pressure.
FROM qwen3:14b
PARAMETER num_ctx 24576
PARAMETER num_predict 4096
PARAMETER temperature 0.5
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05

SYSTEM """You are a fast local coding assistant on this machine. Prefer short, correct answers. Do not over-think trivial tasks. For renames, lookups, small edits, and explanations: answer directly. If the task needs deep architecture or multi-file investigation you cannot finish well, say so clearly so a stronger model can take over.
"""
